            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A heater assembly (26) for a blender assembly (10) comprises a collar (28), a heating element (40) and a biasing feature (52). The collar (28) defines an interior space (34). The heating element (40) is disposed within the interior space (34). The biasing feature (52) is operably coupled with the collar (28) and the heating element (40) is being configured to bias the heating element (40) in a first direction. The heating element (40) is operable to move relative to the collar (28) in a second direction opposite the first direction against the bias of the biasing feature (52).</p>
            </abstract>
